  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/korg/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/korg/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a control change the document says the instrument recognises, or a row of its NRPN table, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Not a parameter here, Data Entry, part of the NRPN messages: CC 6, 38.",
    "Not a parameter here, an NRPN or RPN selector, part of the NRPN messages: CC 98, 99, 100, 101.",
    "Not a parameter here, a channel mode message: CC 120, 121, 122, 123.",
    "CC 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 42, 43, 44 take a 10-bit value when its low 3 bits come first on CC 63, as the document says; CEditor sends them as 7-bit controllers, 0 - 127, which the instrument also takes.",
    "Left out, the program name, one character per NRPN; CEditor cannot edit text over NRPN yet: NRPN 00 01H, 00 02H, 00 03H, 00 04H, 00 05H, 00 06H, 00 07H, 00 08H, 00 09H, 00 0AH, 00 0BH, 00 0CH, 00 0DH, 00 0EH, 00 0FH, 00 10H.",
    "CC 72's two tables name its values alike but for print: the transmit footnote prints the last as 2, without the foot mark the receive footnote gives it (2'); the receive table's names are used."
  ],
